'[Mission Dialog]'

'[info]'
Title = "Shore Patrol";
briefing = "Shore Patrol
Time: October 1, 1993 - 1930 Hours
Location: Port Area - Mogadishu, Somalia

Situation:
Aidid has taken control of a radio transmitter in Habr Gedir territory, near the Mogadishu docks, and is using it to coordinate attacks on U.N. relief efforts. Multiple guards protect the area and the shoreline has been mined.
";
briefing2 = "<cFC8932>Shore Patrol<-co>
OPORD: 9-93 TFR    Date Time: 011900   October 93

1. <ucFC8932>Situation<-uco> 
Aidid has taken control of a radio transmitter in Habr Gedir territory, near the Mogadishu docks, and is using it to coordinate attacks on U.N. relief efforts. Multiple guards protect the area and the shoreline has been mined.
      <cFC8932>Weather:<-co>  Clear, hot, low clouds.
      <cFC8932>Terrain:<-co>  Port area, docks, coastline, warehouses.
      <cFC8932>Enemy:<-co>  Unknown. Minimum 40-50 militia with shoulder arms. Emplaced weapons.

2. <ucFC8932>Mission<-uco> 
      <cFC8932>Who:<-co> Delta Team 5, 2 Ranger Chalks
      <cFC8932>What:<-co> Insert by local boat. Destroy radio equipment. Return to base.
      <cFC8932>When:<-co> 1900 hours, dusk.

3. <ucFC8932>Execution<-uco>
      <cFC8932>Commanders Intent:<-co>  Destroy radio station’s transmitting capabilities.
      <cFC8932>Concept of Operation:<-co>  Your team will board a local fishing boat and make a beach insertion. Locate and destroy radio equipment. Extraction will be by Little Bird at the docks. Two Ranger chalks onboard helos will be available for contingencies.

4. <ucFC8932>Service and Support<-uco>
      <cFC8932>Basic Load:<-co>  CAR15, Shotgun, Satchel Charges

5. <ucFC8932>Command and signal<-uco>
	Task Force chain of command in effect.  Command will coordinate from base. Hand and arm signals TACSOP, with higher via FM primary and SATCOM alternate.  Standard unit CEOI

";

